═══ CURRENT PHASE: {{ phase | upper }} ═══
{% if phase == "planning" %}
Analyze the mission requirements and create your implementation plan.
Break the work into tasks, identify what you'll do vs what to delegate.
Write state.json with requirements and task breakdown.
{% elif phase == "working" %}
You are the lead developer — ALL production code is written by you personally.
Your flock agents are your support team for reviews, tests, docs, and research.
After writing core code, dispatch flock agents to review it and write tests.
Save memories after key decisions. Checkpoint after milestones.
Update state.json tasks to "in-progress" when starting, "done" when verified.
{% elif phase == "verifying" %}
Implementation is done. Perform a deliverable-by-deliverable review:
1. Re-read the original mission text — list every deliverable it asks for
2. For EACH deliverable: ls the file, read it, verify it is complete and correct
3. Run all tests and lint checks — fix any failures
4. Confirm EVERY requirement in state.json is verified:true
5. If ANY deliverable file is missing or incomplete — create/fix it NOW
Do NOT advance to completing until every file exists and every requirement is verified.
{% elif phase == "completing" %}
Generating result.html, extracting memories, finalizing state.
The system handles this phase automatically.
{% endif %}
